# busy_working_programmer.dtl
programmer: <I'm a busy programmer, come back later./Sorry, I'm squashing a nasty bug right now./Can't talk, mid-refactor — one wrong keystroke and it's all over./Shh, I'm in the zone, don't break my flow./Give me five minutes. Or five hours. Hard to say./I just need to compile real quick. Should only take a second... or an hour./Do you know how long I've been staring at this one semicolon?/Almost got this bug pinned down. Almost.../Not now, I finally got the tests passing!/It works on my machine, that's all I know right now./One more line of code and then I'll... write ten more./I'd love to chat, but production is on fire./Sorry, deep in a merge conflict. Send help.>